  "sn12.68:13.1": "",
  "sn12.68:13.2": "In other words, he has attained one of the preliminary levels of awakening (stream entry, once-returning, or non-returning), but not full arahantship. As Mv.I.23.5 shows, even the level of stream entry affords a vision of the deathless.",
  "sn12.68:13.3": "",
  "sn12.68:13.4": "",
  "sn12.68:13.5": "The image refers to two common similes for the full experience of unbinding: (a) it is refreshing &amp; nourishing, like drinking water (see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dhp197-208#dhp205'>Dhp 205</a>); and (b) some arahants experience it as if touching it with the body (see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an9.45'>AN 9:45</a>).",
